OL,3,GNEWSAScotland created Grand Theft Auto
OL,4,A- is its video game industry still
OL,5,Athriving?
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs the world waits for the release of
OL,8,FGrand Theft Auto VI, one of the most
OL,9,Fanticipated entertainment launches in
OL,10,Fhistory, its origins can still be
OL,11,Ftraced back to a group of young
OL,12,Fdevelopers working in Dundee almost 30
OL,13,Fyears ago.
OL,15,FThe original GTA was built by Scottish
OL,16,Fstudio DMA Design, laying the
OL,17,Ffoundations for what would become one
OL,18,Fof the most successful video games
OL,19,Ffranchises ever made.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
