OL,3,GNEWSAScotland created Grand Theft Auto
OL,4,A- is its video game industry still
OL,5,Athriving?
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It was entirely the work of a Scottish
OL,8,Fteam, all novices, we had no games
OL,9,Fdesign degrees at that point," says
OL,10,FBrian Baglow, who worked as a writer on
OL,11,Fthe game.
OL,13,F"The only people who believed in it
OL,14,Fwere DMA Design. The publisher wanted
OL,15,Fto kill it," he says.
